tTime` AS TIMESTAMP), 'EEEE') as day_name,\n","    DATE_FORMAT(CAST(`startTime` AS TIMESTAMP), 'MMMM') as month_name,\n","    \n","    -- Flags\n","    CASE \n","        WHEN DAYOFWEEK(CAST(`startTime` AS TIMESTAMP)) IN (1, 7) THEN 1 \n","        ELSE 0 \n","    END as is_weekend,\n","    \n","    -- Season\n","    CASE \n","        WHEN MONTH(CAST(`startTime` AS TIMESTAMP)) IN (3, 4, 5) THEN 'Spring'\n","        WHEN MONTH(CAST(`startTime` AS TIMESTAMP)) IN (6, 7, 8) THEN 'Summer'\n","        WHEN MONTH(CAST(`startTime` AS TIMESTAMP)) IN (9, 10, 11) THEN 'Autumn'\n","        ELSE 'Winter'\n","    END as season,\n","    \n","    -- Time period\n","    CASE \n","        WHEN HOUR(CAST(`startTime` AS TIMESTAMP)) >= 0 AND HOUR(CAST(`startTime` AS TIMESTAMP)) <= 5 THEN 'Night'\n","        WHEN HOUR(CAST(`startTime` AS TIMESTAMP)) >= 6 AND HOUR(CAST(`startTime` AS TIMESTAMP)) <= 11 THEN 'Morning'\n","        WHEN HOUR(CAST(`startTime` AS TIMESTAMP)) >= 12 AND HOUR(CAST(`startTime` AS TIMESTAMP)) <= 17 THEN 'Afternoon'\n","        ELSE 'Evening'\n","    END as period_of_day,\n","    \n","    -- Peak hour flag\n","    CASE \n","        WHEN HOUR(CAST(`startTime` AS TIMESTAMP)) >= 7 AND HOUR(CAST(`startTime` AS TIMESTAMP)) <= 9 THEN 1\n","        WHEN HOUR(CAST(`startTime` AS TIMESTAMP)) >= 17 AND HOUR(CAST(`startTime` AS TIMESTAMP)) <= 20 THEN 1\n","        ELSE 0\n","    END as is_peak_hour,\n","    \n","    -- Calculated metrics\n","    ROUND(\n","        CAST(`additionalJson.Value` AS DECIMAL(18,2)) / \n","        NULLIF(CAST(`additionalJson.Count` AS INT), 0), 4\n","    ) as avg_per_point_kwh,\n","    \n","    -- Metadata\n","    CAST(`datasetId` AS INT) as dataset_id,\n","    CURRENT_TIMESTAMP() as transformation_timestamp\n","    \n","FROM bronze_raw_data.raw_fingrid_data\n","WHERE \n","    `additionalJson.UserGroup` IS NOT NULL\n","    AND CAST(`additionalJson.Count` AS INT) > 0\n","    AND `startTime` IS NOT NULL;"],"outputs":[{"output_type":"display_data","data":{